    <cap:headline>Fishermen warning</cap:headline>
    <cap:description>Gale Wind (speed reaching 120-130 kmph gusting to 145 kmph) very likely eastcentral Arabian Sea from 16th May morning. Gale Wind (speed reaching 60-70 kmph gusting to 80 kmph) very likely along and off Maharashtra
and Goa Coasts. Sea conditions will be very high to phenomenal over east central Arabian Sea; very rough to high over along and off Maharashtra and Goa Coasts. Fishermen are advised not to venture into these areas.</cap:description>
    <cap:instruction>Action suggested:
• Deep sea fishermen are advised to return to coasts by 14th May.</cap:instruction>
    <cap:web>http://www.rsmcnewdelhi.imd.gov.in</cap:web>
